{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998530/extras/d2bf48ec3641e9c24897cb67ec5be341.avif?t=1758780039\" width=1560 height=469 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death By Misstep</strong> is an upcoming <u>First-Person</u> <u>Rhythm, Stealth and Horror</u> game set on a luxury cruise where a massive massacre by robots is happening. Breathe to the beat of the song's to cover the noise of your breathing and escape this cyberpunk nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong><u>DEMO</u></strong>, you can enjoy the first part of the game, where you'll discover the title's initial rhythmic mechanics. Breathe to the beat of the music, don't let the robots see you, and distract them to go unnoticed. Death By Misstep includes many more rhythmic mechanics, but here you can take a look at the first ones we'll show you on this journey through the Samos cruise ship. Dare to try...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two terrifying levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first taste of the basic rhythmic mechanics of Death By Misstep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying first encounter with the beginning of this cryptic story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998530/extras/ffa94f7350cd9d5776ff5d18c8a073fe.avif?t=1758780039\" width=694 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998530/extras/14164497738c66c863377ff91dc9cba6.poster.avif?t=175